\title{Reinforcement-learning foundations}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{reinforcement-learning}

\p{Reinforcement learning updates a policy from rewards attached to sampled
behavior. Before considering a particular alignment method, this section fixes
the response-level episode, return, value, advantage, policy roles, and
likelihood ratios used by policy-gradient objectives.}

